            <tag> life </tag>
            
        </tags>
      
    </entry>
    
    
    
    <entry>
      <title>Intangible but Colorful</title>
      <link href="/2025/02/19/Love%20is%20Hell/"/>
      <url>/2025/02/19/Love%20is%20Hell/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<link rel="stylesheet" class="aplayer-secondary-style-marker" href="/assets/css/APlayer.min.css"><script src="/assets/js/APlayer.min.js" class="aplayer-secondary-script-marker"></script><p>Love is fated at first sight.</p><p>初见你的我，邂逅了命运。</p><p>Love is seeded at first encountering.</p><p>再见你的我，情根已深种。</p><p>Love is with afflictions.</p><p>爱上你，是我平稳人生中，最大的考验。</p><p>Love is with miracles.</p><p>是我平淡生活里，仅有的传奇。</p><p>Love is, no one can make me the way like you do.</p><p>斯人若彩虹，遇见方知有。</p>]]></content>
      
      
      
